### Test API Endpoints for BookaBeeka

### 1. Search Available Rooms (Public - No Auth Required)
### This should return rooms if data has been seeded
GET http://localhost:8081/api/availability/search?checkIn=2026-09-25&checkOut=2026-09-27
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Register a New Owner/Hotel (Public - Creates Tenant + Owner)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/owner/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelName": "Test Hotel 2",
  "subdomain": "testhotel2",
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "owner@testhotel2.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "currency": "USD",
  "timezone": "America/New_York"
}

### 3. Register a Customer (Public - No Auth Required)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/customers/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Customer",
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "+1234567890"
}
